    <li>Aikman, David, Michael T. Kiley, Seung Jung Lee, Michael G. Palumbo, and Missaka N. Warusawitharana, "Mapping Heat in the U.S. Financial System," Finance and Economics Discussion Series, Divisions of Research and Statistics and Monetary Affairs Working Paper 2015-059, Federal Reserve Board, Washington, DC, June 24, 2015a. (<a rel="noopener noreferrer" class="offsite" target="_blank" href="https://www.federalreserve.gov/econresdata/feds/2015/files/2015059pap.pdf">https://www.federalreserve.gov/econresdata/feds/2015/files/2015059pap.pdf</a>)</li>
    <li>Aikman, David, Michael Kiley, Seung Jung Lee, Michael Palumbo, and Missaka Warusawitharana, "Mapping Heat in the U.S. Financial System: A Summary," FEDS Notes, Federal Reserve Board, Washington, DC, August 5, 2015b. (<a rel="noopener noreferrer" class="offsite" target="_blank" href="https://www.federalreserve.gov/econresdata/notes/feds-notes/2015/mapping-heat-in-the-us-financial-system-a-summary-20150805.html">https://www.federalreserve.gov/econresdata/notes/feds-notes/2015/mapping-heat-in-the-us-financial-system-a-summary-20150805.html</a>)</li>
